### 검색 (Vendor 이름 기준)
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices?vendorName=스타

### 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/invoices

### 저장
POST http://localhost:8080/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": 5,
  "amount": 3,
  "issuedAt": "2026-09-03T10:00:00",
  "category": "Cafe"
}

### 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/invoices/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": 3,
  "amount": 3,
  "issuedAt": "2026-08-19T10:00:00",
  "category": "카페"
}

### 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/invoices/9999999
